      "content": "i feel like i've tried \"resting\" and \"being kind to myself\" a million times and it doesn't actually change anything. the cycle just starts all over again next day. eventually it feels like the only thing that actually stops the noise and the guilt is just... not being here anymore. like, would it really be so bad if i just stopped for good?",
